  ],
  "policy_limits": [
    "Healing amount is a uniform integer within the official inclusive range. The official source supplies endpoints only, not a probability distribution; legacy WorldCombat.heal callers retain Gaussian policy.",
    "DECAY_POTION, POLLUTE_WATER, absolute barriers, potion cooldown/admission, equipped haste and other skill interactions are caller-owned or unsupported M1 effects.",
    "Cure126 is native jade potion ($233), mapped to L1J40017 cure poison. No existing M1 poison ticker or native display wire.",
    "Return162 uses existing town respawn point; clan-return806 and anonymous10014 are distinct and unsupported.",
    "Random teleport uses same-map radius200 square, uniform known can_stand cells; current cell excluded, no bookmarks/doors/occupancy/map restriction policy.",
    "Movement outputs proposals only. Native teleport wire/order UNKNOWN; 4E2C walking and 4EE0 correction are not asserted as teleport.",
    "Speed expiry uses existing combat.expire_buff scheduler; leave clears combat buffs as before.",
    "Blue492 adds max(WIS,11)-5 only to an observed existing natural MP recovery, with the same activity threshold. Tick hook is detached at runtime stop; bound PcState identity limits lifetime. No native blue icon is asserted.",
    "Blind16 and poison cures reuse the optional PlayerMagic state owner and its saved statuses; no cross-feature method calls or replacement of combat methods.",
    "Rows with dispatch_owner=unsupported are data registration only. The independent raw0 frame handler refuses their actual current inventory UID before the legacy generic potion fallback can spend it.",
    "Second-wave owner consumables: foods restore LOCAL fullness and add1HP at an observed natural HP threshold. Wisdom297 and breath417/418 persist official state/duration with query APIs; spell-damage/environment consumers remain unconnected. Identify22 publishes display-only0965 labels while preserving canonical saved names. Curse24 clears LOCAL equipped-item curse state. Clan806/tower15400/sealed15457 refuse without consumption. Tower15410/15430 use explicit LOCAL backend policy and remembered-book destination mapping, not verified Classic server rules."
  ],
